{"c":[{"name":"20261008T080815Z-40413337304fea62","text":"The privacy gate parses apps/caret/Bundle/Info.plist as XML, so a double hyphen inside an XML comment refuses every build-app.sh mode (v2/onboard-privacy ccff2558 rewords it; HI2).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T080815Z-5040e69897a0bba9","text":"VM harness build.sh (h11/h13/h14) exports from a hardcoded worktree W, requires the commit on v2/host, and clones W's node_modules with cp -cR, which copies a symlinked node_modules as a dangling link (HI2).","type":"note"}]}
